        "id": 85015,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-22T14:42:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is pretty much exactly how I play Fanatic as well. The only difference being I play her a little more conservatilvy, since I do not seem to have the luck finding her armor as much as I'd like, and theres only 1 Retribution to find. My preference for a more conservative Fanatic is the reason why I love the Redeemer promo so much, as Emboldening yourself with Absolution in play and her base power allow me find her game changers much more consistently (if at the cost of some raw damage).</p>",
