        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-23T01:46:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Absolution games tend to go that way. &nbsp;I tend to not get Absolution much, so I don't get many of those games.</p><p>I love Fanatic vs. Plague Rat advanced, I'm always begging for that first infection and then lobbying to keep plague locust in play. &nbsp;Really, who needs HP when you can deal damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
